  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Broadcasting Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this next phase of Pacific broadcasting support PCBL&#xa0;will continue to deliver the 24/7 Pasifika TV channel, made up largely of New Zealand content&#xa0;while its Pacific content is increased, to supplement local Pacific media channels.&#xa0;PCBL will also provide training, equipment and contestable funds to Pacific Broadcasters to support increased quality and quantity of local media, and support broadcaster collaboration and interoperability.</narrative>
  </description>
